<title>CHINA: SOCCER - CHINA SOCCER LEAGUE STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER - CHINA SOCCER LEAGUE STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the standings of the Chinese professional soccer league after games on Thursday (tabulated under games played, won, drawn, lost, goals for, goals against and points):</p>
<p> Dalian Wanda	   11    9    2    0    21     4   29</p>
<p> Sichuan Quanxing     11    4    6    1    17     8   18</p>
<p> Beijing Guo'an	 11    4    5    2    22    13   17</p>
<p> Qingdao Hainiu	 11    4    4    3     9     7   16</p>
<p> Shanghai Shenhua     11    3    5    3    14    15   14</p>
<p> Jinan Taishan	  11    3    4    4    10    12   13</p>
<p> Yanbian Aodong	 11    3    4    4     8    10   13</p>
<p> Vanguard Huandao     11    3    3    5    12    14   12</p>
<p> Guangzhou Apollo     11    2    6    3     4    10   12</p>
<p> August First	   11    2    5    4     7    16   11</p>
<p> Tianjin Samsung	11    2    4    5     6    12   10</p>
<p> Guangdong Hongyuan   11    2    2    7     8    17    8</p>
